<title>GERMANY: German ad group TBWA wins Sony Playstation account.</title>
<headline>German ad group TBWA wins Sony Playstation account.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>German advertising agency TBWA Duesseldorf said on Friday its Frankfurt office had won the multimillion mark account of video game unit Sony Playstation and plans to fight off chief competitor Nintendo.</p>
<p>&quot;With an eight-figure budget, several sale offers and consumer events, Sony and TBWA Frankfurt plan to develop the Playstation into a cult entertainment brand,&quot; said Anette Hofer, a TBWA Duesseldorf spokeswoman.</p>
</text>
